CloudBSD GPU detection and optional autoload helpers for DRM kmods.

cloudbsd-gpu-detect lists PCI display devices and prints suggested
kld_list / loader.conf settings for NVIDIA, AMD (amdgpu/radeonkms), and
Intel (i915kms).

Optional rc.d service cloudbsd_gpu loads modules when
cloudbsd_gpu_enable=YES (off by default). NVIDIA modesetting remains
opt-in via cloudbsd_gpu_nvidia_modeset=YES and still requires
hw.nvidiadrm.modeset=1 in loader.conf before boot-time load.
